//! Special-case mappings that differ from Rust's `char::to_uppercase` and
//! `char::to_lowercase`, generated by running the actual Go implementation
//! (`cases.Title(language.Und)`, `golang.org/x/text v0.42.0`) over every scalar
//! value and recording each rune whose title/lower mapping differs from the Rust
//! stdlib one. Regenerate with `go run ./tests/testdata/go_oracle/case_probe`
//! (see that directory's README). The tables are the complete diff: 106 title
//! entries and 2 lower entries, so no unmapped gap is left unmeasured.

